# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and adjust if needed.
#
# Relative path so requests go through the Vite dev proxy (vite.config.ts) as
# same-origin calls — required because the backend issues an auth cookie
# (Lms.Infrastructure sets SameSite=Lax, no CORS policy is configured) and a
# cross-origin fetch straight to the backend origin would be rejected.
# In production, serve this app from behind the same origin/reverse proxy as
# the API (or add a CORS policy + adjust cookie SameSite on the backend) and
# point this at that path.
VITE_API_URL=/api
